          "%md",
          "",
          "###### Prepare the city districts",
          "",
          "The City of Zagreb publishes its 17 city districts (gradske četvrti) as a shapefile on the national open data portal, in HTRS96 / Croatia TM (EPSG:3765).",
          "",
          "1. The database downloads the ZIP with `DBMS_CLOUD.GET_OBJECT` (public URL, no credential).",
          "2. Python reads the shapefile from the ZIP, orients the polygon rings for Oracle Spatial and writes `ZG_DISTRICTS` in WGS84 (SRID 4326), like the other tables of the demo.",
          "3. SQL adds annotations for Select AI and drops the staging table.",
          "",
          "Run this section once. The analysis starts at *Prepare the data*."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization" : "html",
